 type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints></entryLink></entryLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="10" /></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups><profiles><profile id="f3bf-212c-2f4d-459a" name="Steeljack" hidden="false" typeId="2d6001b0-980e-46d2-bcc2-a9fc60109afd" typeName="Unit"><characteristics><characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="c2b4b061-a0fd-499d-8a3d-6ee52587cbd5">Infantry</characteristic><characteristic name="WS" typeId="5ee4ff0b-b244-4670-9d05-91d10f80c32e">3</characteristic><characteristic name="BS" typeId="f6f92f00-8bb1-4afa-8ccb-46310b7dd5e5">3</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="da036dbb-32c2-430a-9dd5-aa74e0c4f74b">5</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="3f9ed75c-36cd-4169-9cef-48391bb55cfd">4</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="17ee558f-3014-4bd2-afc1-b474d8d2b7a8">2</characteristic><characteristic name="I" typeId="a558b3ef-04d0-440e-a312-bac3255bf592">2</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="5dff3e7c-e024-4030-a71d-03195ec06ea7">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="4a42059d-12cd-4c1f-a4c7-bb569d13eeea">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="b215fe72-dbce-4ad6-89ec-c4bb3962c39d">3+</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="5555-1d0f-be69-4b6f" name="Theyn" hidden="false" typeId="2d6001b0-980e-46d2-bcc2-a9fc60109afd" typeName="Unit"><characteristics><characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="c2b4b061-a0fd-499d-8a3d-6ee52587cbd5">Infantry (Character)</characteristic><characteristic name="WS" typeId="5ee4ff0b-b244-4670-9d05-91d10f80c32e">3</characteristic><characteristic name="BS" typeId="f6f92f00-8bb1-4afa-8ccb-46310b7dd5e5">3</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="da036dbb-32c2-430a-9dd5-aa74e0c4f74b">5</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="3f9ed75c-36cd-4169-9cef-48391bb55cfd">4</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="17ee558f-3014-4bd2-afc1-b474d8d2b7a8">2</characteristic><characteristic name="I" typeId="a558b3ef-04d0-440e-a312-bac3255bf592">2</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="5dff3e7c-e024-4030-a71d-03195ec06ea7">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="4a42059d-12cd-4c1f-a4c7-bb569d13eeea">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="b215fe72-dbce-4ad6-89ec-c4bb3962c39d">3+</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="7c65-673c-feb8-42cb" name="Very Bulky" hidden="false"><description>Very Bulky models instead count as three models.</description></rule><rule id="2f84-7c29-0717-4e54" name="Relentless" hidden="false"><description>This unit has the Relentless special rule (see the main rulebook).</description></rule><rule id="e4cc-2faa-df48-4f9a" name="Eye of the Ancestors" hidden="false"><description>Whenever an enemy destroys one of your units or slays a model with the character unit subtype in a challenge, that enemy has caught the ire of the Votann. Place a Grudge token next to it to denote this effect. Each enemy unit tracks their own Grudge tokens separately, up to a maximum of three per enemy unit. Independent Characters attached to units use the Grudge tokens of the unit they are attached to. If an enemy Independent Character leaves their unit, they gain the same amount of Grudge tokens that their unit had prior. Conversely, if an enemy Independent Character with Grudge tokens attaches themselves to a unit, use the higher of the Grudge token pools between them and discard the other. Your Leagues of Votann units gain stacking bonuses depending on how many Grudge tokens the target enemy unit has, their effects incrementally increasing to match the heightened threat of the foe. 1: Leagues of Votann units are Stubborn while engaged with an enemy unit with a Grudge token. 2: Leagues of Votann units suffer Hatred against an enemy unit with 2 tokens. 3: Leagues of Votann units gain the Preferred Enemy special rule against an enemy unit with 3 tokens. In addition, characters with this rule cannot refuse challenges. If an enemy issues a challenge, a character model with this rule must accept the challenge.</description></rule><rule id="76cb-ab18-2ad4-47cd" name="Void Armour" hidden="false"><description>Models with this special rule automatically pass Dangerous Terrain tests. In addition, vehicles with this rule count as having Extra Armour.</description></rule><rule id="9f14-cdb0-ba63-4577" name="Purge Response" hidden="false"><description>This unit's Overwatch hits on unmodified Hit rolls of 5+ instead of the usual 6+.</description></rule></rules><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="110" /></costs></selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="ab2e-28d2-2273-21fb" name="Cthonian Earthshakers" hidden="false" type="unit" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="27dd-1ec1-6fee-468a" name="Heavy Support" hidden="false" targetId="abf5fd55-9ac7-4263-8bc1-a9fb0a8fa6a6" primary="true" /></categoryLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="677a-a63f-5e72-4799" name="Earthshaker Team" hidden="false" type="model" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="1697-11dd-8ee3-41d2" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="e70b-fd7c-00b7-4afb" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><entryLinks><entryLink id="18bb-2dcf-3eba-4c69" name="Earthshaker Launcher" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" targetId="s3-esl" type="selectionEntry"><constraints><constraint id="d383-e246-49f2-47da" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="300f-d016-168f-48da" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints></entryLink></entryLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="af36-6ab4-b8a4-4d53" name="Additional Earthshaker Team" hidden="false" type="model" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="6f4c-9aee-3c01-4f00" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="4ad0-c1d7-70f1-437c" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><entryLinks><entryLink id="1c08-0df4-fd50-4f65" name="Earthshaker Launcher" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" targetId="s3-esl" type="selectionEntry"><constraints><constraint id="f107-e262-a307-42ce" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="f381-d359-4546-4f1f" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints></entryLink></entryLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="60" /></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries><profiles><profile id="fc45-f668-7a64-4bcd" name="Earthshaker Team" hidden="false" typeId="2d6001b0-980e-46d2-bcc2-a9fc60109afd" typeName="Unit"><characteristics><characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="c2b4b061-a0fd-499d-8a3d-6ee52587cbd5">Infantry</characteristic><characteristic name="WS" typeId="5ee4ff0b-b244-4670-9d05-91d10f80c32e">4</characteristic><characteristic name="BS" typeId="f6f92f00-8bb1-4afa-8ccb-46310b7dd5e5">3</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="da036dbb-32c2-430a-9dd5-aa74e0c4f74b">3</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="3f9ed75c-36cd-4169-9cef-48391bb55cfd">4</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="17ee558f-3014-4bd2-afc1-b474d8d2b7a8">3</characteristic><characteristic name="I" typeId="a558b3ef-04d0-440e-a312-bac3255bf592">2</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="5dff3e7c-e024-4030-a71d-03195ec06ea7">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="4a42059d-12cd-4c1f-a4c7-bb569d13eeea">9</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="b215fe72-dbce-4ad6-89ec-c4bb3962c39d">5+</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="adcc-6d73-8c5c-4ec6" name="Extremely Bulky" hidden="false"><description>Extremely Bulky models count as five models for the purposes of Transport Capacity.</description></rule><rule id="9faf-6c43-e252-432c" name="Feel No Pain (5+)" hidden="false"><description>This unit has the Feel No Pain (5+) special rule (see the main rulebook).</description></rule><rule id="eaeb-9370-b6c8-4775" name="Eye of the Ancestors" hidden="false"><description>Whenever an enemy destroys one of your units or slays a model with the character unit subtype in a challenge, that enemy has caught the ire of the Votann. Place a Grudge token next to it to denote this effect. Each enemy unit tracks their own Grudge tokens separately, up to a maximum of three per enemy unit. Independent Characters attached to units use the Grudge tokens of the unit they are attached to. If an enemy Independent Character leaves their unit, they gain the same amount of Grudge tokens that their unit had prior. Conversely, if an enemy Independent Character with Grudge tokens attaches themselves to a unit, use the higher of the Grudge token pools between them and discard the other. Your Leagues of Votann units gain stacking bonuses depending on how many Grudge tokens the target enemy unit has, their effects incrementally increasing to match the heightened threat of the foe. 1: Leagues of Votann units are Stubborn while engaged with an enemy unit with a Grudge token. 2: Leagues of Votann units suffer Hatred against an enemy unit with 2 tokens. 3: Leagues of Votann units gain the Preferred Enemy special rule against an enemy unit with 3 tokens. In addition, characters with this rule cannot refuse challenges. If an enemy issues a challenge, a character model with this rule must accept the challenge.</description></rule><rule id="3dc6-db30-7732-48de" name="Slow and Purposeful" hidden="false"><description>A unit that contains at least one model with this special rule cannot Run, Turbo-boost, move Flat Out, perform Sweeping Advances or fire Overwatch. However, they can shoot with Heavy, Salvo and Ordnance weapons, counting as stationary even if they moved in the previous Movement phase. They are also allowed to charge in the same turn they fire Heavy, Ordnance, Rapid Fire or Salvo weapons.</description></rule><rule id="8486-e66f-6f26-4cc2" name="Void Armour" hidden="false"><description>Models with this special rule automatically pass Dangerous Terrain tests. In addition, vehicles with this rule count as having Extra Armour.</description></rule></rules><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="120" /></costs></selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="404b-ece8-66b8-37b2" name="Berehk Stornbröw" hidden="false" type="model" collective="false" import="true">
      <comment>Unique. Rebuilt from VOTANN_DEX_REDUX.pdf.</comment>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="04b3-f38d-3738-16d4" type="max" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="ada1-fe79-9308-7d5a" name="Berehk Stornbröw" hidden="false" typeId="2d6001b0-980e-46d2-bcc2-a9fc60109afd" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="c2b4b061-a0fd-499d-8a3d-6ee52587cbd5">Infantry (Character)</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="5ee4ff0b-b244-4670-9d05-91d10f80c32e">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="f6f92f00-8bb1-4afa-8ccb-46310b7dd5e5">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="da036dbb-32c2-430a-9dd5-aa74e0c4f74b">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="3f9ed75c-36cd-4169-9cef-48391bb55cfd">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="17ee558f-3014-4bd2-afc1-b474d8d2b7a8">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="a558b3ef-04d0-440e-a312-bac3255bf592">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="5dff3e7c-e024-4030-a71d-03195ec06ea7">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="4a42059d-12cd-4c1f-a4c7-bb569d13eeea">8</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Save" typeId="b215fe72-dbce-4ad6-89ec-c4bb3962c39d">5+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="c4c3-ee32-1fcf-40fe" name="Independent Character" hidden="false"><description>This model is an Independent Character.</description></rule>
        <rule id="bfe6-6ce0-97d3-4337" name="Feel No Pain (4+)" hidden="false"><description>This model has the Feel No Pain (4+) special rule.</description></rule>
        <rule id="64c0-3e32-5966-4751" name="Furious Charge" hidden="false"><description>This model has the Furious Charge special rule.</description></rule>
        <rule id="b040-78cd-b90f-48ce" name="Waaaghbreaker" hidden="false"><description>Berehk Stornbröw and the unit he joins gain the Preferred Enemy (Orks) special rule. While an enemy Ork WAAAGH! is active, your entire army gains the Preferred Enemy (Orks) special rule.</description></rule>
        <rule id="0ecb-782f-9bc5-45f8" name="Eye of the Ancestors" hidden="false"><description>Whenever an enemy destroys one of your units or slays a model with the character unit subtype in a challenge, that enemy has caught the ire of the Votann. Place a Grudge token next to it to denote this effect. Each enemy unit tracks their own Grudge tokens separately, up to a maximum of three per enemy unit. Independent Characters attached to units use the Grudge tokens of the unit they are attached to. If an enemy Independent Character leaves their unit, they gain the same amount of Grudge tokens that their unit had prior. Conversely, if an enemy Independent Character with Grudge tokens attaches themselves to a unit, use the higher of the Grudge token pools between them and discard the other. Your Leagues of Votann units gain stacking bonuses depending on how many Grudge tokens the target enemy unit has, their effects incrementally increasing to match the heightened threat of the foe. 1: Leagues of Votann units are Stubborn while engaged with an enemy unit with a Grudge token. 2: Leagues of Votann units suffer Hatred against an enemy unit with 2 tokens. 3: Leagues of Votann units gain the Preferred Enemy special rule against an enemy unit with 3 tokens. In addition, characters with this rule cannot refuse challenges. If an enemy issues a challenge, a character model with this rule must accept the challenge.</description></rule>
        <rule id="5ab5-3ac8-68af-4cd8" name="Steady Advance" hidden="false"><description>A unit composed entirely of models with this rule do not count as having moved while in the shooting phase. Whenever a unit with this rule declares to Run in the shooting phase, always move 3" instead of rolling to determine the distance.</description></rule>
        <rule id="e4d3-2060-d2fc-40a9" name="Void Armour" hidden="false"><description>Models with this special rule automatically pass Dangerous Terrain tests. In addition, vehicles with this rule count as having Extra Armour.</description></rule>
        <rule id="bde8-0d61-0bad-45a2" name="Warlord Trait: Grim Demeanour" hidden="false"><description>When fielded as your Warlord, Berehk Stornbröw has the Grim Demeanour warlord trait (the Warlord gains the Fearless and the It Will Not Die special rules) instead of rolling to generate one.</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <categoryLinks><categoryLink id="025c-2368-73f5-4383" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="848a6ff2-0def-4c72-8433-ff7da70e6bc7" primary="true" /></categoryLinks>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry id="a5b7-92d8-43ae-4b42" name="Kromlôk's Revenge" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="be59-a054-416a-47d7" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="a4d9-33ba-fa0c-435e" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="9208-6a84-cea7-4635" name="Kromlôk's Revenge" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="a6383362-5aa8-4ff0-b1d0-00e059fc9d45">+2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="6abee736-f8d3-498e-97ac-a5c68445609f">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Melee, Unwieldy, Sunder, Two-handed, Vengeance</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile></profiles><rules><rule id="f7c0-9aff-b2ca-4856" name="Vengeance" hidden="false"><description>When attacking, the wielder rolls an additional Attack for every Grudge Token on the enemy unit.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry id="ffb4-863c-b977-fd29" name="Warlord" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false" import="true">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="c0d8-dfaf-a746-07f6" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" />
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" />
          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
      <entryLinks><entryLink id="d123-786d-4c5a-48b7" name="Assault Grenades" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" targetId="eq-20410" type="selectionEntry"><constraints><constraint id="04b5-203e-2575-47b6" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="e5eb-e718-da84-4aff" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints></entryLink></entryLinks>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="135" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry>
  <selectionEntry id="eq-20014" name="Comms Array" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="rule-20015" name="Comms Array" hidden="false"><description>A unit with a model that is equiped with a Comms Array may use the leadership characteristic of the Warlord as if he was joined to the unit.</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="eq-20016" name="Exo-Armour" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="rule-20017" name="Exo-Armour" hidden="false"><description>A model wearing Exo-Armour has a save characteristic of a 3+ and improves their Toughness by one. In addition, models wearing Exo-Armour gain the Bulky and Relentless special rules, but cannot Run or make sweeping advances.</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="eq-20018" name="Magna-Coil Bike" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="rule-20019" name="Magna-Coil Bike" hidden="false"><description>A model equipped with a Magna-Coil Bike changes its unit type to Jetbike. (The PDF names the Magna-Coil Bike and the Jetbike type but does not define either; Jetbike movement and toughness are those of the 7th edition rulebook Jetbike type.)</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="eq-20020" name="Mass Driver Accelerators" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="rule-20021" name="Mass Driver Accelerators" hidden="false"><description>A model equipped with Mass Driver Accelerators gains the Move Through Cover and Hammer of Wrath special rules.</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="eq-20022" name="Medipack" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="rule-20023" name="Medipack" hidden="false"><description>A model equiped with a medipack confers their unit the feel no pain 6+ special rule.</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="eq-20024" name="Pan Spectral Scanner" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="rule-20025" name="Pan Spectral Scanner" hidden="false"><description>Enemy units reduce their cover save by 1 when making saves against attacks from a unit equiped with a Pan Spectral Scanner.</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="eq-20026" name="RAM Shield" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="rule-20027" name="RAM Shield" hidden="false"><description>A model equipped with a RAM Shield improves their Armour Save characteristic by one to a maximum of a 2+. For every wound saved by the bearer in combat, inflict an automatic S4 AP- hit onto the enemy unit that made the attack.</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="eq-20028" name="Rampart Crest" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="rule-20029" name="Rampart Crest" hidden="false"><description>A model equipped with a Rampart Crest possesses a 5+ invulnerable save. Additionally, enemies who shoot at a unit containing a model with a Rampart Crest worsen the AP of their ranged weapon profiles by 1 when resolving that shooting attack. (A weapon with AP3 turns into AP4, etc.)</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="eq-20030" name="Teleport Crest" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="rule-20031" name="Teleport Crest" hidden="false"><description>A model equiped with a Teleport Crest confers the Deep Strike special rule to the bearer's unit and counts as a Locator Beacon.</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="eq-20032" name="Ward Crest" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="rule-20033" name="Ward Crest" hidden="false"><description>A model equipped with a Ward Crest grants a 4+ invulnerable save to the bearer.</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="eq-20034" name="Weavefield Crest" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="rule-20035" name="Weavefield Crest" hidden="false"><description>A unit containing a model equipped with a Weavefield Crest gains a 6+ Invulnerable save.</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="wpn-20036" name="Concussion Gauntlet" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile id="prof-20037" name="Concussion Gauntlet" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464">Melee</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="a6383362-5aa8-4ff0-b1d0-00e059fc9d45">+3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="6abee736-f8d3-498e-97ac-a5c68445609f">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Melee, Unwieldy, Concussive, Specialist Weapon</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="wpn-20038" name="Concussion Hammer" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile id="prof-20039" name="Concussion Hammer" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464">Melee</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="a6383362-5aa8-4ff0-b1d0-00e059fc9d45">x2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="6abee736-f8d3-498e-97ac-a5c68445609f">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Melee, Unwieldy, Concussive, Sunder, Specialist Weapon</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles><rules><rule id="6098-a369-5d47-4836" name="Sunder" hidden="false"><description>Attacks with this special rule may re-roll failed Armour Penetration rolls against Vehicles and Buildings (both with Shooting Attacks and in close combat) and re-roll Glancing Hits, in an attempt to instead get a Penetrating Hit, but the second result must be kept.</description></rule></rules>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="wpn-20040" name="Darkstar Axe" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile id="prof-20041" name="Darkstar Axe" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464">Melee</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="a6383362-5aa8-4ff0-b1d0-00e059fc9d45">+1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="6abee736-f8d3-498e-97ac-a5c68445609f">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Melee, Fleshbane, Darkstar, Unwieldy, Specialist Weapon</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles><rules><rule id="4ca3-a6ef-e485-4e8d" name="Darkstar" hidden="false"><description>Wounds caused by this weapon cannot be negated by the Feel No Pain special rule.</description></rule></rules>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="wpn-20042" name="Dôzr Knux" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile id="prof-20043" name="Dôzr Knux" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464">Melee</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="a6383362-5aa8-4ff0-b1d0-00e059fc9d45">+1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="6abee736-f8d3-498e-97ac-a5c68445609f">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Melee, Specialist Weapon, Brawler</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles><rules><rule id="6271-512a-9b34-4056" name="Brawler" hidden="false"><description>For each initial attack that successfully hits with this weapon, roll an additional attack before rolling To Wound.</description></rule></rules>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="wpn-20044" name="Heavy Plasma Axe" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile id="prof-20045" name="Heavy Plasma Axe" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464">Melee</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="a6383362-5aa8-4ff0-b1d0-00e059fc9d45">+2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="6abee736-f8d3-498e-97ac-a5c68445609f">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Melee, Unwieldy, Rending, Two Handed</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costs>
    </selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="wpn-20046" name="Plasma Axe" hidden="false" type="upgrade" collective="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile id="prof-20047" name="Plasma Axe" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
